OL,3,GNEWSAHelen Jenner likely to take over
OL,4,Aas Reform Wales leader, sources tell
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform is likely to appoint Helen
OL,8,FJenner to take over from Dan Thomas as
OL,9,Fthe party's Welsh leader, sources have
OL,10,Ftold BBC Wales.
OL,12,FIt is understood she is the favourite
OL,13,Fto replace Thomas, who quit following
OL,14,Fan arrest on suspicion of assault, and
OL,15,Fthat "very senior" Reform figures had
OL,16,Fbacked her.
OL,18,FJenner, an MS for Bangor Conwy Mon, is
OL,19,Fthe party's interim Welsh leader and
OL,20,Fwas Thomas' deputy.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
